  "limitation": "Removes the per-rebuild allocation of the whole-length arrays of large bindless rebuilds on the GPU thread (cache scratch and threaded snapshots); measured on the host with doubles for pools, textures and backend. Texture creation by pool lookups, a new entry's delta state, the Vulkan backend, arrays longer than 1048576 elements and threaded snapshots in flight beyond eight per element type are unchanged. Device array lengths and render-thread lag are assumptions. The share of the device's scene-transition allocations and GC pauses this removes is known only from a device run (bindings allocatedKiB, gcPause)."
}
